    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "Cgroup v2 (unified hierarchy) was merged in 4.5 [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/34a9304a96d6351c2d35dcdc9293258378fc0bd8) and is now the default on modern distros.",
      "source_hash": 720807371583868338,
      "context_hash": 6825261047773325173,
      "translation": "Cgroup v2(통합 계층 구조)는 4.5에서 병합되었으며 [(커밋)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/34a9304a96d6351c2d35dcdc9293258378fc0bd8), 현재 최신 배포판에서 기본값입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609282Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:19/seg:1",
      "source": "Most subsystems support only v2.",
      "source_hash": 7209940495450422768,
      "context_hash": 17867940619156215396,
      "translation": "대부분의 서브시스템은 v2만 지원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "subsystems": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609282Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The single hierarchy",
      "source_hash": 16065701971598015833,
      "context_hash": 1167598388908942321,
      "translation": "단일 계층 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609282Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "All cgroup v2 resources hang off a single filesystem at `/sys/fs/cgroup`:",
      "source_hash": 9073790553781785643,
      "context_hash": 4291082692002150901,
      "translation": "모든 cgroup v2 리소스는 `/sys/fs/cgroup`의 단일 파일 시스템 아래에 놓입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609282Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Key data structures",
      "source_hash": 886646788032546680,
      "context_hash": 11661494726294608343,
      "translation": "주요 자료 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Key Data Structures": "주요 자료 구조",
        "data structures": "자료 구조"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609282Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "struct cgroup",
      "source_hash": 10378306881184426271,
      "context_hash": 219469379613679676,
      "translation": "struct cgroup",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609283Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "struct cgroup_subsys_state (CSS)",
      "source_hash": 2251124271586939234,
      "context_hash": 10704601391610963949,
      "translation": "struct cgroup_subsys_state (CSS)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609283Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Each controller attaches per-cgroup state via a CSS:",
      "source_hash": 1643389238256643645,
      "context_hash": 9140155812005513428,
      "translation": "각 컨트롤러는 CSS를 통해 cgroup별 상태를 연결합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup",
        "controller": "컨트롤러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609283Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Controllers (cpu, memory, io, etc.) embed a `cgroup_subsys_state` as their first field:",
      "source_hash": 13537914682060018578,
      "context_hash": 9812441590308648122,
      "translation": "컨트롤러(cpu, memory, io 등)는 `cgroup_subsys_state`를 첫 번째 필드로 내장합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "controllers": "컨트롤러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609284Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "struct cgroup_subsys",
      "source_hash": 17881328718068561683,
      "context_hash": 2771036508585867369,
      "translation": "struct cgroup_subsys",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609284Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Each controller registers itself:",
      "source_hash": 9590276808730509894,
      "context_hash": 1355444094546849280,
      "translation": "각 컨트롤러는 스스로를 등록합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "controller": "컨트롤러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609284Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Enabling controllers",
      "source_hash": 9752406617292015864,
      "context_hash": 3351696245329549095,
      "translation": "컨트롤러 활성화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "controllers": "컨트롤러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609284Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Controllers must be explicitly enabled in the subtree:",
      "source_hash": 1044556836110068740,
      "context_hash": 9994611782954339996,
      "translation": "컨트롤러는 하위 트리에서 명시적으로 활성화해야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "controllers": "컨트롤러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609284Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**No Internal Process Constraint**: in v2, a cgroup cannot hold both processes and child cgroups.",
      "source_hash": 7075635071849358909,
      "context_hash": 8811813847376009063,
      "translation": "**내부 프로세스 금지 제약(No Internal Process Constraint)**: v2에서 cgroup은 프로세스와 자식 cgroup을 동시에 가질 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup",
        "cgroups": "cgroup",
        "process": "프로세스",
        "processes": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609285Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Only leaf cgroups (cgroups with no children) and the root cgroup can hold processes directly.",
      "source_hash": 18081200504710955005,
      "context_hash": 12567325773350228250,
      "translation": "리프 cgroup(자식이 없는 cgroup)과 루트 cgroup만 프로세스를 직접 가질 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup",
        "cgroups": "cgroup",
        "processes": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609285Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "css_set: the task-to-cgroup link",
      "source_hash": 12105155799588594886,
      "context_hash": 16591519241241605530,
      "translation": "css_set: 태스크와 cgroup 간의 연결",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609286Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each task has a pointer to a `css_set`, which holds references to one CSS per active controller:",
      "source_hash": 17561355110814154060,
      "context_hash": 32204390023171401,
      "translation": "각 태스크는 `css_set`에 대한 포인터를 가지며, 이 `css_set`은 활성화된 컨트롤러마다 하나의 CSS에 대한 참조를 보유합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "controller": "컨트롤러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609286Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "CSS sets are shared: if two tasks are in exactly the same set of cgroups (one per controller), they share a `css_set`.",
      "source_hash": 366284915497842909,
      "context_hash": 3967351762337813067,
      "translation": "CSS 집합은 공유됩니다: 두 태스크가 정확히 같은 cgroup 집합(컨트롤러당 하나)에 속해 있으면 두 태스크는 하나의 `css_set`을 공유합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroups": "cgroup",
        "controller": "컨트롤러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609286Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "This keeps the number of css_set objects small.",
      "source_hash": 7944921891610312688,
      "context_hash": 9397982836665099968,
      "translation": "이를 통해 css_set 객체의 수를 적게 유지합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:14.609287Z",
      "issues": []
    },
